      "text": "Find two people who personally knew the deceased and have no financial interest in the estate — not heirs, beneficiaries, or relatives who may inherit."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "name": "Complete the Affidavit of Heirship form",
      "text": "Fill in the deceased's family history, list all heirs and their relationships, describe the property using its exact legal description, and state that the affiant has personal knowledge of the facts."
    },
    {
